{ % @columns: 32 % }

{ % A long comment that wraps
 before the following class
 attribute % .marked }
Paragraph after the comment.

> { % A long comment inside a
>  block quote that needs to
>  retain its indentation % }
> Paragraph after the comment.

- { % A long comment inside a
   list item that needs to
   retain its indentation % }
  Paragraph after the comment.

Paragraph outside the list.

> > { % A nested comment with a
> >  literal > marker that must
> >  survive wrapping % }
> > Paragraph after the comment.

> { % Already wrapped comment
>  with a literal >not-a-marker
>  % }
> Paragraph after the comment.
